import Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Bicategory.Adjunction.Basic

/-!
# Adjunctions in bicategories

Mathlib's `CategoryTheory.Bicategory.Adjunction` is the canonical notion of an
adjunction between 1-morphisms. It owns the unit, counit, triangle identities,
adjoint equivalences, composition, and transport by pseudofunctors.
-/
